	<key>PayloadDescription</key>
	<string>Adds the CareCircle app to your Home Screen. Help for seniors with chatting, shopping and companionship. It only adds an app icon: it does not change any settings, install certificates or manage your device. Remove it any time in Settings &gt; General &gt; VPN &amp; Device Management.</string>
